  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 01}可是……太麻烦你了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e300/e310_050.bf.json:51:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_048",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3D 01}……我说。\n你干嘛那么拘谨？\n你才１０岁吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e300/e310_050.bf.json:52:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_049",
